# NOTE: rules_multirun uses Python, which causes issues with `bazel run` when
# using remote execution from a different host platform (e.g., macOS -> Linux RBE).
# See: https://github.com/keith/rules_multirun/issues/43
# A Go port exists (PR #57) but isn't ready for use yet.
# Workaround: Push images from CI (Linux) or use scripts/push_all_images.sh,
# which runs the per-image push targets sequentially without rules_multirun.
